# Council-experts catalog should never carry secrets — explicit deny list
# per Hunt's defence #6 (Council Review β 2026-05-15-beta-catalog).
*.env
*.token
*.key
id_*
.ssh/
credentials*.json
*.pem
*.p12
# Sibling skill dirs that contain runtime caches / auth — should never be
# referenced from a catalog file
.auth-cache/
*.auth-token
